## ✨ Design Patterns Applied

### 1. Adapter Pattern
Abstracts provider-specific implementations, enabling plug-and-play provider switching with zero coupling.

### 2. Facade Pattern
`MailService` provides a simplified interface that hides the complexity of provider selection, fallback logic, and health monitoring.

### 3. Singleton Pattern
Single `MailService` instance ensures consistent provider health tracking and efficient resource usage across the application.

### 4. Circuit Breaker Pattern
Automatically tracks provider failures and temporarily disables unhealthy providers to prevent cascading failures.

