## 🎓 SOLID Principles

- ✅ **Single Responsibility**: Each adapter handles exactly one provider
- ✅ **Open/Closed**: New providers can be added without modifying existing code
- ✅ **Liskov Substitution**: All adapters are interchangeable via `IMailAdapter`
- ✅ **Interface Segregation**: Clean, minimal interface with only required methods
- ✅ **Dependency Inversion**: Business logic depends on abstractions, not implementations

